@startuml
autonumber
actor Admin
actor User
participant "Identity Service" as Identity
database "Postgres (Security DB)" as DB
participant "Legacy Monolith" as Monolith
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "Telemetry Service" as Telemetry
participant "WebSocket Service" as WS

== 1. Вход и настройка системы (Admin) ==
Admin -> Identity : POST /auth/login (admin credentials)
Identity -> DB : Verify credentials
Identity --> Admin : Auth Token (Admin Role)

Admin -> Identity : POST /api/v1/houses (Register House)
Identity -> DB : INSERT INTO houses
Identity --> Admin : House Created (UUID)

Admin -> Identity : POST /api/v1/users (Register User)
Identity -> DB : INSERT INTO users
Identity --> Admin : User Created (UUID)

Admin -> Identity : POST /api/v1/houses/{id}/assign-user
note right: Связывает пользователя с объектом
Identity -> DB : INSERT INTO user_houses
Identity --> Admin : Access Linked

== 2. Работа Пользователя ==
User -> Identity : POST /auth/login
Identity --> User : Auth Token (User Role)

User -> Identity : POST /api/v1/houses/{id}/devices
note right: Указывает, какой датчик (ID из монолита)\nустановлен в этом доме
Identity -> DB : INSERT INTO device_ownership
Identity --> User : Device Module Linked

== 3. Поток телеметрии ==
entity "IoT Sensor" as Sensor
Sensor -> MQTT : pub: device/telemetry {id, value, auth_key}
MQTT -> Telemetry : Dispatch
Telemetry -> Identity : Validate(id, key)
Identity --> Telemetry : Valid (Target: House A)

Telemetry -> Monolith : PATCH /api/v1/sensors/{id}
Monolith -> DB : Update sensors table
Telemetry -> MQTT : internal/notify
MQTT -> WS : Forward
WS -> User : WebSocket: Real-time Update
@enduml